# Flow 1, create and type (report 037 section 6): Home > New note, a name, Enter: the note is made empty and opens in the
# editor; what is typed is saved 1.5 s after the last key (the title's dot goes); Tab writes a real tab; Ctrl+S saves now;
# Esc goes back.
wait 900
tap "New note"
tap "New note"
wait 400
expect state page new
expect text "Create"
shot 01-new-note
check new-note
type Antenna ideas
wait 100
shot 02-name
key enter
wait 500
expect state page editor
expect state note "Antenna ideas.md"
expect file "Antenna ideas.md" exists
expect state title "Antenna ideas"
type # Antenna ideas
key enter
key enter
type A folding dipole on the lid.
key enter
type - [ ] measure the SWR
wait 200
expect state dirty 1
expect state title "Antenna ideas ●"
shot 03-typing
check typing
wait 1700
expect state dirty 0
expect state last_save ok
expect state title "Antenna ideas"
expect file "Antenna ideas.md" contains "# Antenna ideas\n\nA folding dipole on the lid.\n- [ ] measure the SWR"
shot 04-saved
# Tab at the start of the line: a real tab in the file (shown as a glyph); Ctrl+S saves at once
key home
key tab
key ctrl-s
wait 300
expect state notice Saved
expect file "Antenna ideas.md" contains "\n\t- [ ] measure the SWR"
shot 05-tab
# Shift+Tab takes it off again
key backtab
key ctrl-s
wait 300
expect file "Antenna ideas.md" contains "\n- [ ] measure the SWR"
key esc
wait 400
expect state page home
expect state notes 1
